WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.021
Quasitraces that aren't traces.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.169
A quasitrace adds up correctly only on commuting elements.

3
00:00:06.319 --> 00:00:08.363
Kaplansky asked whether it always adds.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.351
Build an algebra where adding always fails,

5
00:00:11.351 --> 00:00:13.367
by at least one hundred forty-fourth.

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.653
Claimed: so no tracial state exists.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.492
Lean-checked, bound included.
